<title>GERMANY: TABLE-Kali+Salz H1 profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kali+Salz H1 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>KASSEL, Germany 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     11	vs   6</p>
<p>    Group sales (not comparable)*	  38	vs  44</p>
<p>    Group sales (comparable)		 35	vs  33</p>
<p>    Capital investment			  3	vs   1</p>
<p>    Staff (headcount)			 295	vs 285</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German potash firm is Kali und Salz Beteiligungs AG.</p>
<p>* The firm said that due to certain accounting changes, the raw figures for group sales in H1 1997 could not be directly compared with figures for H1 1996. Adjusted data were therefore provided.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
